          "topic": "MiniJinja 3.0 release",
          "text": "If you are using MiniJinja, I finally released 3.0 which gets rid of Serde as a default dep, supports free threading, fixes tons of legacy cruft, runs quite a bit faster and is just overall nicer. If you want to play with it, there is a WASM demo here: mitsuhiko.github.io/minijinja/",
